WEBVTT

00:10:56.459 --> 00:11:00.740
if we can find them, and to seek out the heroines

00:11:00.740 --> 00:11:02.326
who are there,

00:11:02.326 --> 00:11:06.115
who show real courage, who bring people together,

00:11:06.115 --> 00:11:09.703
and to nudge our sons to identify with those heroines

00:11:09.703 --> 00:11:13.188
and to say, "I want to be on their team,"

00:11:13.188 --> 00:11:17.770
because they're going to be on their team.

00:11:17.770 --> 00:11:21.464
When I asked my daughter who her favorite character was in "Star Wars,"

00:11:21.464 --> 00:11:23.493
do you know what she said?

00:11:23.493 --> 00:11:25.996
Obi-Wan.

00:11:25.996 --> 00:11:29.893
Obi-Wan Kenobi and Glinda.

00:11:29.893 --> 00:11:33.360
What do these two have in common?